imeout"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The session events to track; both by default. Leaving one out, or both, tracks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"none of that kind, and every record still carries its session’s key.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"kinds"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s file; leave it to its default."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"file"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s module and file name; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"fileID"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s enclosing declaration; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"function"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s line; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"line"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s column; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"column"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The enricher, which runs on the tracker’s worker like any other.","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing is put in a session until the app turns it on, among the enrichers it builds its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker with, so every event the tracker tracks carries the key, through any copy of it:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.sessions()])"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Inactivity is measured between records’ timestamps, the time each event was tracked, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not when the tracker’s worker reaches it. So the app returning from the background past the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"timeout starts a new session with its first event, such as "},{"code":"ApplicationOpened","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (module"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"LifecycleTracking","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and one returning sooner goes on with the same."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The first event the tracker tracks starts the first session: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" comes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before it, stamped with its time. A session ends only when an event comes after the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"timeout: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", stamped with the time of the session’s last event, then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", stamped with the new event’s, come before that event. So a run’s last"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"session ends with no "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": a destination takes its end from its last event. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"session event carries the key of the session it starts or ends, and the context the event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that ended the session had when this enricher reached it; the enrichers after this one run"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on them too. Their call site is this call’s."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A session’s identifier is a random UUID, never derived from anything, held in this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enricher’s memory and nowhere else: neither a store nor anything else writes it to disk,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a new enricher, as on the next launch, starts with a new session. Records a store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kept from an earlier run aren’t enriched again, so they carry no key."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The enricher’s sessions are its own, created by this call: give each tracker its own call.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Precondition","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"timeout","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is more than zero.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://Sessions/documentation/Sessions/SessionEnded":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionEnded"}],"title":"SessionEnded","url":"\/documentation\/sessions\/sessionended","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionEnded"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A session ended, having lasted "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded\/duration"},{"type":"text","text":": what "},{"code":"Enricher.sessions(timeout:kinds:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" tracks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when an event comes after the timeout’s inactivity, before the next session’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"doc://Sessions/documentation/Se